  "description": "\"It took a year. Until I forgot you, until I got up again...\"\n\nIn the third year of middle school, Seo-Yun runs away from school after receiving an indelible wound from the person he loved. Finally he decides to go to high school and joins the leadership club with great aspirations, but the members of the leadership club who seemed perfect are all strange and unusual people...?\n\nA bittersweet romance full of twists and tears! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
